<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?>
<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xml:lang="en" ttp:timeBase="media" ttp:cellResolution="32 15"><head><metadata><ttm:title>HOW 2 GET AWAY WITH MURDER</ttm:title><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1">South Arcade</ttm:agent><ttm:item type="album">HOW 2 GET AWAY WITH MURDER</ttm:item><ttm:item type="spotify_id">2VoU7RnUBTp3mxFJBhUIPX</ttm:item></metadata><styling><style xml:id="s1" tts:color="#FFFFFF" tts:fontSize="100%" tts:textAlign="center" tts:fontFamily="sansSerif" tts:fontStyle="normal" tts:fontWeight="bold" /><style xml:id="bg_vocal" tts:color="#A0A0A0" tts:fontStyle="italic" /></styling><layout><region xml:id="r1" tts:origin="10% 10%" tts:extent="80% 80%" tts:displayAlign="center" /></layout></head><body><div><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:18.832" end="00:22.500">I wake up, feeding time</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:22.500" end="00:26.400">I got a taste for your flesh on my mind</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:26.400" end="00:30.976">And there's something about it     that seems justified</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:30.976" end="00:34.999">No, I won't make the night without it</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:34.999" end="00:37.400">I got a perfect place for staging our crime</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:37.400" end="00:39.010">Pull up with the name to Mr Nice Guy</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:39.010" end="00:42.400" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(Baby, I'll make you bleed, so baby don't play with me)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:42.400" end="00:47.104">And there's something inside him that I can't deny</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:47.104" end="00:50.372">And that makes him my next target</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:50.372" end="00:53.455">So, cut the cord, save the words</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:53.455" end="00:56.501">Make you wanna scream, say a prayer</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:56.501" end="01:00.000">But you're messing with the wrong team</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:00.000" end="01:04.180">In a world that's always out to hurt you</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:04.180" end="01:12.180">This is how 2 get away with murder</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:21.602" end="01:25.511">You won't stop (won't stop) asking why (in my mind)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:25.511" end="01:29.516">You're telling me I should've been on your side (how can I stop?)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:29.516" end="01:33.518">And now you're stuck on my table 'cause blood never lies</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:33.518" end="01:36.434">And I could do this every night</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:36.434" end="01:38.000">You got me working up an appetite</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:38.000" end="01:40.550">So, cut the cord, save the words</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:40.550" end="01:43.502">Make you wanna scream, say a prayer</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:43.502" end="01:47.556">But you're messing with the wrong team</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:47.556" end="01:51.387">In a world that's always out to hurt you</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:51.387" end="01:59.387">This is how 2 get away with murder</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:01.696" end="02:03.881">And I could do this every single night</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:03.881" end="02:05.585">You got me working up an appetite</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:05.585" end="02:07.545">And I could do this every single night</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:07.545" end="02:15.545">You got me working up an- (ah- ah-)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:25.564" end="02:27.585">Cut the cord, save the words</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:27.585" end="02:30.596">Make you wanna scream, say a prayer</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:30.596" end="02:34.126">But you're messing with the wrong team</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:34.126" end="02:38.110">In a world that's always out to hurt you</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:38.110" end="02:41.592">This is how 2 get away with murder</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:41.592" end="02:43.092" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(And I could do this every single night)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:42.618" end="02:44.999" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(You got me working up an appetite)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:44.999" end="02:46.499" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(And I could do this every single night)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:46.104" end="02:50.104">This is how to get away with murder</p></div></body></tt>